[{"title":"挽胡景芳","author":"杨荣","text":"盛世才名自昔稀，曾看白发到春闱。\n不教姓字题金榜，空遣文章老布衣。\n五夜案头萤尚在，千年海上鹤应归。\n萧萧落木文江路，马鬣寒云锁翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽主事王洪","author":"杨荣","text":"一夕悲风起夜台，兰苕秀质倏倾摧。\n九京己作骑鲸梦，半世空怜倚马才。\n蒿里凄凉朝露积，钱塘寂寞暮潮回。\n悬知穷达皆由命，始信冯唐最可哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽金凤仪","author":"杨荣","text":"儒官早遂少年游，绣斧光华继马周。\n綵翮孤飞誇鸑鷟，霜蹄一蹶惜骅骝。\n荐书方达黄金阙，召记先登白玉楼。\n碧嶂清江家万里，西风旅榇在归舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽宋尚书","author":"杨荣","text":"早有声华著外台，还陪宗伯见多才。\n垂绅已喜登廊庙，听履应宜位鼎台。\n遥望旌麾云外去，俄惊旅榇峡中回。\n九重紫诰隆褒赠，不独生荣死亦哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽郑长史","author":"杨荣","text":"辅导亲藩早著声，至今清望重乡评。\n无人载酒询奇字，有子登朝播令名。\n华表鹤归秋月冷，空山马鬣暮云平。\n为公展卷思遗德，忍赋招魂倍怆情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽古尚书朴","author":"杨荣","text":"华发萧萧坐庙堂，南京政简足徜徉。\n明时共喜芳名播，晚节欣逢泰运昌。\n己荷恩荣颁紫诰，宁期梦寐入黄粱。\n司徒清鉴当时重，简册他年定有光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽松斋","author":"杨荣","text":"羡君高谊与谁伦，自昔芳名动缙绅。\n道拾遗珠还故主，廪捐积粟赈饥民。\n乌声杂雨山花落，马鬣封云墓草新。\n赖有诸孙能继述，豸冠文采映青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送佥宪王孟坚之江西","author":"杨荣","text":"萧散乡园已数秋，又承徵诏别林丘。\n词垣簪笔荣名久，宪府乘骢宠渥优。\n衣绣三秋辞北阙，观风十月到南州。\n明时文运昭奎壁，御敕龙光贯斗牛。\n兴学正期追往古，育才端儗继前修。\n外台五夜秋霜肃，泮水三春化雨周。\n共说松筠清节劲，更期桃李绿阴稠。\n西江自昔推文献，料得明珠不暗投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周职方致仕还乡","author":"杨荣","text":"字水仁山是故乡，先朝簪绂有馀光。\n道宗茂叔家声远，派接磻州世泽长。\n分职王门多谏诤，横经泮水育才良。\n蒹葭己历秋霜老，桃李曾沾化雨香。\n秩转成均秦博士，名高粉署汉仙郎。\n握兰久著金闺籍，投老先辞玉笋行。\n天上正期星北拱，云边惊见雁南翔。\n五湖归去舟应远，三径行吟菊未荒。\n昼听松风閒偃仰，夜看萝月自徜徉。\n二疏汉代高风在，九老香山俗虑忘。\n此日分携歌白雪，满头素发陋冯唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题边文进花木翎毛","author":"杨荣","text":"翠袖逢春自不寒，湘江云散水漫漫。\n飞来青鸟知何处，误作仙源树里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨菊","author":"杨荣","text":"闻道柴桑景最幽，晚凉清兴到林丘。\n墨池一夜西风起，染出东篱一片秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面小景 其一","author":"杨荣","text":"一川澄练石梁孤，隔岸云林过雨馀。\n松下老翁应有待，谷城何处更传书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面小景 其二","author":"杨荣","text":"石桥流水带斜晖，应有人家隔翠微。\n坐久不知明月上，露华偏湿薜萝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"杨荣","text":"谁家老屋枕溪濆，十里青山半是云。\n此处更无尘迹到，秪应啼鸟隔花闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"杨荣","text":"小桥流水漾晴沙，杖策归来日未斜。\n昨夜东风花落尽，一林高树锁烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其一","author":"杨荣","text":"十里晴山景嶂开，水边花木映亭台。\n此中风景应无限，自有兰舟载酒来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其二","author":"杨荣","text":"溪头垂柳拂青丝，溪水粼粼漾碧漪。\n想得幽居多胜槩，芰荷风细雨凉时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其三","author":"杨荣","text":"万叠青山隐薜萝，千寻瀑布落银河。\n白云冉冉生衣上，红叶离离满涧阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其四","author":"杨荣","text":"千仞瑶华拥翠峦，深深林密玉光寒。\n轻舟一棹归何处，疑是山阴月夜看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪梅","author":"杨荣","text":"姑射仙姿不涴尘，还教滕六助精神。\n那知一段冰霜态，付与时人为写真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题折枝翎毛四首 其一 山桃画眉","author":"杨荣","text":"片片红霞入脸匀，妆成秾艳照青春。\n山禽亦有风流意，画得双蛾八字新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题折枝翎毛四首 其二 栀子寒雀","author":"杨荣","text":"栀子花开素影低，哺雏野雀趁幽栖。\n上林更是春光好，莫与鹪鹩饮啄齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题折枝翎毛四首 其三 木犀鸲鹆","author":"杨荣","text":"不肯低飞向野蒿，从来栖息爱清高。\n广寒无数黄金粟，吹得天香入羽毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题折枝翎毛四首 其四 梅花翠禽","author":"杨荣","text":"翡翠丛深雪霁迟，一枝冷蕊斗琼肌。\n十年不到罗浮洞，又是参横月落时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38958,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题师侍郎画四首 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"几树垂杨覆水亭，双双白鸟度云屏。\n飘然一棹来相访，正是山人午睡醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38959,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题师侍郎画四首 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"红白山花相映开，山中径路久无媒。\n老翁不是看花客，只共扁舟载鹤来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38960,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其三","author":"杨荣","text":"遥看瀑布落寒汀，野服乌巾自在行。\n好似匡山读书处，满林红叶夜猿声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38961,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题师侍郎画四首 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"千山万壑冻无声，一棹夷犹溪上行。\n兴尽归来卿莫笑，多情何似不留情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38962,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五马图","author":"杨荣","text":"霜蹄雾鬣气腾虹，日并天闲十二中。\n自是清时无战伐，四郊苜蓿老西风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38963,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题子昂竹","author":"杨荣","text":"自是吴兴笔法奇，琅玕随意墨淋漓。\n几回犹忆吹箫处，正是秋山月落时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38964,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栗图","author":"杨荣","text":"山果经霜欲熟时，苞如刺猬碧参差。\n早知战慄承天意，不遣龙沙涕泪垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38965,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五马图","author":"杨荣","text":"天闲五马最雄奇，万里骁腾识骏姿。\n龙种自应充内厩，岂同凡马谩驱驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菜","author":"杨荣","text":"淡荡东风二月初，过畦春雨长嘉蔬。\n齑盐自是先贤事，犹有清芬在画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题十八学士四首 其一 琴","author":"杨荣","text":"退直从容出禁林，如何托兴在瑶琴。\n?弹解愠南薰曲，不待知心识赏音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题十八学士四首 其二 棋","author":"杨荣","text":"清拟蓬瀛海上洲，閒将胜负决纹楸。\n笑谈咫尺心千里，一似留侯默运筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题十八学士四首 其三 书","author":"杨荣","text":"笔底云烟落素屏，金辉玉润势逾清。\n看来定是虞文懿，独擅临池万古名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题十八学士四首 其四 画","author":"杨荣","text":"弘文馆下论思馀，徙倚临风看画图。\n举目河山今一统，经营曾是赞良谟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹赠教谕胡舟","author":"杨荣","text":"数枝潇洒翠烟浓，玉立亭亭泮水东。\n遥想绛帷开讲处，诸生应得被清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹赠弋阳令","author":"杨荣","text":"谁种扶疏一两竿，晴梢袅袅舞青鸾。\n西风忽送潇湘雨，散作琴堂九夏寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹 其一","author":"杨荣","text":"雨过江头夕照收，苍苔白石自清幽。\n不知昨夜蛟龙起，化作潇湘一片秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹 其二","author":"杨荣","text":"海上移来怪石奇，绿云深处竹猗猗。\n雨声昨夜春雷动，应是神龙化葛陂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹 其三","author":"杨荣","text":"凉云晴压绿枝低，涧底珊瑚长欲齐。\n爱对繁阴清似洗，几回扫径独留题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅石处士诗卷后","author":"夏原吉","text":"晋宋有明哲，陶林相后先。\n陶以菊自逸，林以梅称仙。\n芳誉蔼当代，高名照遗编。\n今我赵处士，抱道希昔贤。\n孑孑谢世故，悠悠乐林泉。\n买梅更买石，栽布轩窗前。\n梅兮肖清白，石兮表贞坚。\n清白期不秽，贞坚冀无谖。\n岁晏万物瘁，梅芳石初鲜。\n拉彼林下叟，觞咏梅石边。\n诗成倚梅歌，酒醉拂石眠。\n歌声落寒玉，眠席分晴烟。\n俯仰眉睫外，细大徒諠諠。\n讵如梅与石，及我同一天。\n所以永结托，要躐陶林肩。\n集贤诸大老，交素知其然。\n爰赠梅石号，重赋梅石篇。\n铿锵振金玉，至今子孙传。\n恨予生太晚，不能拜当年。\n翘翘仰梅石，作诗写馀笺。\n写罢复展诵，清风竦毛颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题常执中无息斋","author":"夏原吉","text":"天道何刚健，运行若机旋。\n昼夜弗暂息，今古或无愆。\n四时以代谢，万物资陶甄。\n嗟哉果何如，惟其一诚焉。\n不见古君子，体道心拳拳。\n贤兮则希圣，圣兮则希天。\n兢兢著谟典，亹亹垂诗篇。\n宣尼叹逝水，孟氏称源泉。\n禹阴分寸惜，陶甓朝昏迁。\n铦锥季子读，圆枕温公眠。\n所进虽各异，所志同一坚。\n眷彼蚩蚩氓，相去霄壤悬。\n灵台既茫昧，德基任摧颠。\n高明邈难入，污下甘伏跧。\n晚途或有悔，畴能返流年。\n吾湘常氏子，学古知其然。\n高斋扁无息，翼翼临江边。\n不华亦不隘，非郭亦非廛。\n轩窗贮经史，几席罗毫笺。\n端居究玄赜，终日惟乾乾。\n德业遂精进，声华益昭宣。\n徵书忽相迫，试艺临文渊。\n琳琅有馀响，隙吹胡能联。\n英英冠多士，籍籍膺高铨。\n暂别京国友，远泛端溪船。\n民事固杂沓，夙心敢云谖。\n朝焉戴星出，夕焉戴星还。\n吏案无留牍，琴堂弗闻鞭。\n一篝照清夜，典籍还穷研。\n匪曰钓时誉，所希在圣贤。\n顾我何放旷，百行无一全。\n庸庸窃君禄，华发将垂肩。\n感子名斋义，自愧还自怜。\n壮心日以钝，安能重磨镌。\n愿子慎终始，勿谓百里牵。\n鹏抟必九万，骥骋须三千。\n矧今圣明世，简拔无私偏。\n坦荡青云路，会当恣高骞。\n周览上林春，满挹龙楼烟。\n对扬吐奇蕴，献纳摅忠虔。\n跻民太和域，致君唐虞前。\n功名著青史，耿耿千秋传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题彭希益惜阴堂","author":"夏原吉","text":"星沙控荆湖，属邑十有二。\n罗湘甲西北，山水独佳丽。\n彭君生其间，钟此山水异。\n襟宇既轩豁，丰仪更清粹。\n垂髫被庭训，诗礼日讲肄。\n谆谆期有成，勉勉冀无坠。\n岂谓霜露严，毒被椿木瘁。\n彷徨痛遗业，感慨念先志。\n乾乾仰居诸，耿耿忘食寐。\n搆堂名惜阴，于以自箴励。\n朝斯万卷开，夕尔一篝继。\n探搜圣贤心，玩索古今事。\n毫芒靡或遗，纤悉必精至。\n时当大比秋，蹋槐赴乡试。\n声华动场屋，文藻贲同类。\n惟君自持谦，不欲早干位。\n春闱暂垂翮，卒业辟雍地。\n清修日益勤，阃奥愈深诣。\n嗟予素薄劣，忝有乡曲谊。\n每瞻惜阴堂，中心窃怀愧。\n愿言慎终始，毋使亏一篑。\n行当驭长风，扶摇九天际。\n宫花醉蒲萄，黄金耀名字。\n远追伊召心，光辅尧舜治。\n功成铭鼎彝，芳誉永无替。\n回视惜阴堂，煌煌孰能企。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谕饥乌","author":"夏原吉","text":"饥乌来屋头，轩然振双翼。\n哑哑向我啼，其意欲得食。\n我行顾我厨，馀糗颇云积。\n粲粲白如银，瑩瑩燥如炙。\n足可疗乌饥，尽与非所惜。\n缘以目前人，困乏动千亿。\n赈恤未有方，夙夜慨中赤。\n况此所馀糗，粒粒出民力。\n我食尚怀愧，饲乌宁不惕。\n饥乌勿此啼，山林有榛栗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日闻蛙","author":"夏原吉","text":"蓐收已回辕，玄冥正司令。\n草木尽黄落，蛰虫俯而静。\n尔蛙何从来，恍焉失初性。\n凌寒发狂声，聒聒莫知竟。\n捕之良可矜，聆之顾非正。\n愿尔深自默，毋为骇时听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面庄子观泉","author":"夏原吉","text":"银潢半天来，窈窕几千尺。\n空林送清声，遥壁荡晴色。\n炎晨坐披襟，凉气拍胸臆。\n吁嗟南华翁，高怀有谁识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泉州次吴中书韵","author":"夏原吉","text":"区区南闽来，蓂荚屡更易。\n鞍马厌道途，风霜改絺绤。\n岂无林渊思，民痍未痊革。\n引睇桐城楼，寒云万山白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿槜李天宁寺","author":"夏原吉","text":"息轺古招提，时维孟冬莫。\n天气熙如春，宵蛩起幽诉。\n独聆不能眠，披衣坐风露。\n缅怀踏歌人，翘翘亦何故。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武康县","author":"夏原吉","text":"湖州武康县，僻在群山中。\n人稀官事少，土沃禾稼丰。\n蚕时户户箔，鸡晓家家舂。\n鲜菱采秋夏，嫩笋庖春冬。\n廛幽商寡集，溪曲舟难通。\n儿童拙市语，父老高村容。\n淳淳良可尚，扰扰希能同。\n愧无召杜吏，重造朱陈风。\n作诗慰我民，政俗宜自隆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠琴士李忠礼","author":"夏原吉","text":"伟哉太白孙，英英越中士。\n来作湘江游，光风晔兰芷。\n抱琴为予弹，清音惊俗耳。\n雍雍凤鸾声，悠悠圣贤理。\n他日遇钟期，毋惭奏流水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱塘江","author":"夏原吉","text":"浩渺惟天阔，茫洋与海通。\n赭龛分左右，吴越界西东。\n鸥弄潮头雪，龙吟水面风。\n鸱夷在何处，试问打鱼翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经姑苏","author":"夏原吉","text":"客路尚悠悠，苏台暂系舟。\n酒旗迷柳岸，商舶隘江流。\n三让祠何古，千人石更幽。\n可怜城下水，莫洗馆娃愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友","author":"夏原吉","text":"忆昔会皇州，壶觞日劝酬。\n一时同作客，万里各经秋。\n湘浦西风棹，燕山夜月楼。\n无穷萧索意，两地一般愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆别四首 其一","author":"夏原吉","text":"忆别金陵日，高堂晓拜辞。\n谆谆垂训语，切切问归期。\n缩地嗟无术，看云谩赋诗。\n聊凭问安字，远慰倚闾思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆别四首 其二","author":"夏原吉","text":"忆别金陵日，那胜手足情。\n泪县棠棣雨，肠断鹡鸰声。\n姜被清宵冷，璠玙何日迎。\n愿言知此意，蚤促北来程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆别四首 其三","author":"夏原吉","text":"忆别金陵日，吾儿岁始三。\n见人容嶷嶷，学语舌喃喃。\n虽乏麒麟誉，应无豚犬惭。\n行当还帝里，为汝说周南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆别四首 其四","author":"夏原吉","text":"忆别金陵日，春风二月时。\n求朋莺语急，送客燕飞迟。\n北邸俄淹岁，南归未卜期。\n遥遥天上友，莫动暮云思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东吴述怀三首 其一","author":"夏原吉","text":"为客东吴郡，秋过冬复深。\n梅妆昆阜玉，橘剪洞庭金。\n颠倒还家梦，彷徨恋阙心。\n何时了王事，兰棹起归音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东吴述怀三首 其二","author":"夏原吉","text":"为客东吴郡，民艰日转深。\n抚躬惭食禄，汗颡愧腰金。\n愿广乾坤泽，均濡草木心。\n万方歌至治，永叶太平音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东吴述怀三首 其三","author":"夏原吉","text":"为客东吴郡，年深情亦深。\n每惭三省语，常畏四知金。\n落落谁青眼，寥寥自赤心。\n寄言天上友，雁到好传音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题医者蒋彦升凤山书屋","author":"夏原吉","text":"幽居对凤台，凤去几时来。\n济世书千卷，怡神酒一杯。\n秋风橘颗熟，春雨杏花开。\n自是县壶侣，都人莫浪猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓云居庵次韵答联上人","author":"夏原吉","text":"谁辟云居境，依稀古化城。\n狮柑霜过熟，凤竹雨来青。\n石悟禅中语，钟收饭后声。\n我来临绝顶，一览小蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊金沙洲","author":"夏原吉","text":"晚泊金沙洲，晓登洲上楼。\n云峰随处好，烟浪拍天浮。\n扫壁看遗墨，凭栏数过舟。\n家山应不远，此地且优游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]